  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Starlight Symphony — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>At 18th level, you have completed your technique, allowing you to expand your domain. Your domain is an expansive field of fog with two towering spirits at the north and south. All creatures other than you are completely blinded by the cursed fog within your domain and suffer the effects of your <em>Cursed Fog</em>. At initiative 20, all creatures take 5d10 cold damage as they struggle to breathe in the cursed fog.</p>",
